Actually, we only want to do HTTP fallback if **all** UDP is blocked. Because the netcheck policy above doesn't guarantee it'll hit every server. We just relaxed it (https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale/commit/44b07aa70889d14949ad08d7ce4455207236423c) and will probably relax it more in the future.

So let's just do something like:

```go
    if !anyV4() {
         var wg sync.WaitGroup // for HTTPS checks
         for _, server := range stuns4 {
               ...
         }
         wg.Wait()
    }
```

